# Helpy Cursor Rules

## Critical Patterns - DO NOT MODIFY

### Meals.tsx Structure

The Meals page MUST use the exact same structure as ToDo and Expenses:

```tsx
<div className="min-h-screen bg-background pb-40">
  <div className="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 page-content">
    <header className="sticky top-0 z-20 bg-background -mx-4 px-4 sm:-mx-6 sm:px-6 ...">
```

Key rules:
1. Header INSIDE the `page-content` wrapper (not outside)
2. Header uses `-mx-4 px-4 sm:-mx-6 sm:px-6` to extend edge-to-edge
3. Use `useLayoutEffect` (NOT `useEffect`) for auto-scroll
4. NO scroll-pending/scroll-ready classes

See `docs/MEALS_SCROLL_FIX.md` for details.

---

## Code Style

- Use Tailwind CSS for styling
- Follow existing component patterns
- Keep translations in the `t` object
- Use `useScrollHeader` hook for sticky header animations
- Use `useScrollLock` when modals are open
